of lojban, but finding no resource or ways.

The few times over the years i tried the so called lojban dictionary:
http://jbovlaste.lojban.org/
and i don't remember once it was helpful.

Where or how can a learner of lojban, when encountering such a new 
grammar words (cmavo), find out its meaning or usage?

